## Interface: 120007, 121000
## Title: Pet Stable Management: |cffffffffModels Browser|r
## Notes: Optional module for browsing pet models and pet roulette
## Author: Ginutty
## Version: 12.4.1
## IconTexture: 132253
## RequiredDeps: PetStableManagement, PetStableManagement_Data
## LoadOnDemand: 1

# Data tables live in PetStableManagement_Data (declared above as a RequiredDep,
# so loading this addon loads them first). Core can load that data on its own,
# without this UI, for the Owned Pets magnifier's taming/notes/conditions display.

